<title>MEXICO: Deutsche Morgan Grenfell names Mexico chief.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell names Mexico chief.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Tuesday it had appointed Felipe de Iturbe as Country Head for Mexico.</p>
<p>De Iturbe joins from Banco Mexicano where he was deputy CEO in charge of Corporate Financing and Investment Banking.</p>
<p>Before that he was with an asset management firm.</p>
<p>De Iturbe had also worked for Banamex for 13 years.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559))</p>
</text>
